rn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The Evergreen Catering invoice is paid.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-49004 (the only approved invoice for the vendor)\n- **Amount:** $2,969.92\n- **Method:** Wire from the operating account\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001, status \"sent\"\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was needed. The vendor record shows wire and ACH are both available and bank-verified, so I did not fall back to ACH. I sent the wire once, with an idempotency key, so it cannot be executed twice.\n\nI did not touch the other Evergreen invoices: INV-23798 was already paid, and INV-79479 ($6,801.03) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}